    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L056",
      "original_quote": "紫微金宮四歲花，初一尋豬初二龍，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L057",
      "original_quote": "順進三步逆退一，先陰後陽是其基，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L058",
      "original_quote": "惟有初二辰上起，退三進四逆尋跡。",
