    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L084",
      "original_quote": "戌土五龍居其中，初一午上二亥宮，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L085",
      "original_quote": "逆行二宮安一日，惟有九日不能均，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L086",
      "original_quote": "十居辰上初居寅，二十九日五上尋，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L087",
      "original_quote": "二宮一日順三次，退二三次又逆回，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L088",
      "original_quote": "惟有六日無正位，逢四對宮去追尋。",
      "tag": []
