      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L115",
      "original_quote": "進三退二各一日，逆回三步是生時，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L116",
      "original_quote": "先陽後陰逆退二，另有進一各期端，",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan2_Ding5Ju_L117",
      "original_quote": "退二安一退二日，順進五宮方是基。",
      "tag": []
